    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5309,
        "endIndex": 5496,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** While lifting macroeconomic export totals, government officials and economists highlighted severe economic concentration risks if global cloud AI capex slows down"
      },
