      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 5551,
        "endIndex": 5939,
        "text": "#### [11] Moonshot AI files confidentially for Hong Kong IPO at $50B valuation target\n* **What is confirmed:** Media reports from *The Information* and Chinese financial outlets indicate Beijing-based Moonshot AI (creator of Kimi K3) filed a confidential A1 listing application with the Hong Kong Stock Exchange and is negotiating a pre-IPO funding round targeting a $50 billion valuation"
