    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 6180,
        "endIndex": 6569,
        "text": "#### [13] Meta adjusts employee review guidance on \"tokenmaxxing\" and promotes Hatch agent\n* **What is confirmed:** *Wired* reported on September 3, 2026, that Meta updated internal performance review guidance to reduce pressure on employees regarding \"AI-driven impact\" and heavy token usage (\"tokenmaxxing\"), while urging teams to experiment with its new personal AI agent project, Hatch"
      },
