    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 6702,
        "endIndex": 7091,
        "text": "#### [15] Microsoft restructures financial reporting into two segments (Agents & Infra, Devices & Consumer)\n* **What is confirmed:** Microsoft submitted an SEC Form 8-K on September 2, 2026, announcing it will shift from three operating segments to two starting in FY27: **Agents and Infra** (Azure, Microsoft 365, server licensing) and **Devices and Consumer** (Windows, Xbox, search/ads)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
